<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="651449678"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:25.253"><div begin="15.186" end="28.907" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="15.186" end="18.953" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.186" end="15.674">若这</span><span begin="15.674" end="17.510">一束吊灯</span><span begin="17.510" end="18.348">倾泻下</span><span begin="18.348" end="18.953">来</span></p><p begin="19.098" end="22.186" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.098" end="19.570">或者</span><span begin="19.570" end="20.201">我</span><span begin="20.277" end="21.414">已不会存</span><span begin="21.414" end="22.186">在</span></p><p begin="22.450" end="24.778" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.450" end="23.411">即使你不</span><span begin="23.411" end="24.778">爱</span></p><p begin="26.089" end="28.907" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.089" end="27.221">亦不需要分</span><span begin="27.221" end="28.907">开</span></p></div><div begin="30.587" end="44.794" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="30.587" end="34.462" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.587" end="31.060">若这</span><span begin="31.060" end="32.983">一刻我竟</span><span begin="32.983" end="33.821">严重痴</span><span begin="33.821" end="34.462">呆</span></p><p begin="34.726" end="37.471" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.726" end="34.972">根</span><span begin="34.972" end="35.816">本不</span><span begin="35.816" end="36.689">需要被</span><span begin="36.689" end="37.471">爱</span></p><p begin="37.637" end="40.264" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.637" end="39.124">永远在床上发</span><span begin="39.124" end="40.264">梦</span></p><p begin="41.601" end="44.794" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.601" end="42.716">余生都不会</span><span begin="42.716" end="43.258">再</span><span begin="43.258" end="43.579">悲</span><span begin="43.579" end="44.794">哀</span></p></div><div begin="47.283" end="1:00.434" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="47.283" end="50.435" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begi